OL,3,AGavin and Stacey actor hopes his band
OL,4,Awill be 'the next Stereophonics'
OL,5,
OL,6,FGavin and Stacey fans will likely
OL,7,Fremember Oscar Hartland, or Neil the
OL,8,FBaby, for his heart-warming performance
OL,9,Fof The Beatles' Blackbird in the
OL,10,Fsitcom's 2024 finale.
OL,12,FThe episode was watched by about 12.3m
OL,13,Fpeople on Christmas day and saw
OL,14,FHartland's character serenade the crowd
OL,15,Fat the wedding of his on-screen dad
OL,16,FSmithy, played by James Cordon.
OL,18,FBut that was just the start for
OL,19,FHartland, now 17, who says his band is
OL,20,Faiming to be "the next 'Phonics, or
OL,21,Fsomething like that".
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
